            "question": "Does the scanner really cost nothing upfront?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes — with a minimum lab spend of €1,500 per month, the Helios 700 is installed and your whole team trained by us at no upfront cost. It exports open STL files, so it fits your existing lab workflow as well as DentSure.</p>"
